    "id": "pw8-fm-bell",
    "name": "FM BELL",
    "author": "Patchwork Eight Engineering",
    "description": "Uses the feedback_bell algorithm template: OP2 phase-modulates OP1, which self-feedback-modulates before phase-modulating carrier OP0. Inharmonic modulator ratios (3.5, 7.0) plus self-feedback give a metallic, bell-like decay.",
